  "description": "<p data-start=\"251\" data-end=\"498\">Ga op avontuur in de <strong data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"287\">Galar-regio</strong> met <strong data-start=\"292\" data-end=\"310\">Pokémon Shield</strong>, een uitgebreide RPG waarin je nieuwe Pokémon ontdekt, uitdagende gyms verslaat en een groots verhaal beleeft. Met Dynamax- en Gigantamax-vormen worden gevechten spectaculairder dan ooit.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"622\">Dit exemplaar verkeert <strong data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"541\">In Nette Staat</strong>, volledig getest en 100% functioneel.<br data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"582\">Wordt <strong data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"621\">standaard met doosje geleverd</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"641\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"833\">\r\n<li data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"677\">\r\n<p data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"677\">🐾 Ontdek de nieuwe Galar-regio</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"717\">\r\n<p data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"717\">⚔️ Dynamax- en Gigantamax-gevechten</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"759\">\r\n<p data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"759\">🌈 Nieuwe Pokémon en regionale vormen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"797\">\r\n<p data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"797\">🏆 Uitdagende gyms & verhaalmodus</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"833\">\r\n<p data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"833\">👥 Online en lokale multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"838\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"862\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"1062\">\r\n<li data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"892\">\r\n<p data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"892\"><strong data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"875\">Titel:</strong> Pokémon Shield</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"926\">\r\n<p data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"926\"><strong data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"908\">Platform:</strong> Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"956\">\r\n<p data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"956\"><strong data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"939\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"986\">\r\n<p data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"986\"><strong data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"969\">Genre:</strong> RPG / Avontuur</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1033\">\r\n<p data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1033\"><strong data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1001\">Spelers:</strong> 1 • Online/lokaal multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1062\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1062\"><strong data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1049\">Geleverd:</strong> Met doosje</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1067\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1102\"><strong data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1092\">Incl. Garantie:</strong> 1 maand</h3>",
